# Vivado build output under */fpga/. `reports/` is rewritten by every build
# and is never evidence on its own; a record that needs a build's numbers
# copies the directory to a dated reports_<tag>_<date>/ snapshot and cites
# that. Snapshots committed before 2026-11-23 stay tracked (an ignore rule
# does not touch tracked files); a new snapshot is local unless the record
# that cites it adds it deliberately with `git add -f`.
**/fpga/reports/*
!**/fpga/reports/.gitkeep
**/fpga/reports_*/
